{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1419112-are-there-any-vtts-with-solid-exalted-3rd-support","id":1419112,"title":"Are there any VTTs with solid Exalted 3rd support?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-19T20:39:39-07:00","id":1419112,"title":"Are there any VTTs with solid Exalted 3rd support?","content":"I've not been paying much attention to Exalted for a while, but I'd like to get back into it. In the covid world, all my games are online-only, so I'm interested in virtual table-top support for Exalted 3. I don't suppose I'd need much more than solid character sheets and a dice-roller.<br /> <br /> Roll20 has a Solars sheet but it hasn't been touched in a couple of years and there's no dragon-blood or lunars support.<br /> <br /> Is there anything good out there?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9009-evil-aardvark","name":"Evil Aardvark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T20:40:35-07:00","id":1419113,"title":"","content":"I've been running on Roll20 and the 3E sheet I found has drop downs for DB at least and does correctly calculate essence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"use