 didn't spot the Dragon Blooded being in there, that's good to know.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>No problem!<br /> <br /> As far as dice go, the Sidekick dicebot for discord works pretty well with a little fiddling.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T17:52:40-07:00","id":1419272,"title":"","content":"I believe Astral Tabletop has some kind of semi-official support? I've never used it myself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T21:16:14-07:00","id":1419291,"title":"","content":"Ive done Discord and just told everyone we're using the honor system.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T14:52:51-07:00","id":1419450,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1419112-are-there-any-vtts-with-solid-exalted-3rd-support?p=1419291#post1419291\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ive done Discord and just told everyone we're using the honor system.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> For me it isn't about trust - it is about support. My fellow players are not big on &quot;knowing the first thing about the rules&quot;, so I need to help them as we get into new systems. A shared view of a character sheet is really vital to that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9009-evil-aardvark","name":"Evil Aardvark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T14:59:51-07:00","id":1419453,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1419112-are-there-any-vtts-with-solid-exalted-3rd-support?p=1419272#post1419272\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I believe Astral Tabletop has some kind of semi-official support? I've never used it myself.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I was hopeful, so I tried it out and, it has an Exalted logo on the front page, it has Exalted 3E in the &quot;Create Character&quot; menu, but when I selected it, I was presented with &quot;No Template&quot; and given a blank page. I might be missing something but...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9009-evil-aardvark","name":"Evil Aardvark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T15:23:19-07:00","id":1419458,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evil Aardvark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1419112-are-there-any-vtts-with-solid-exalted-3rd-support?p=1419453#post1419453\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I was hopeful, so I tried it out and, it has an Exalted logo on the front page, it has Exalted 3E in the &quot;Create Character&quot; menu, but when I selected it, I was presented with &quot;No Template&quot; and given a blank page. I might be missing something but...</div> </div> </div> </div>No, that was my problem with astral too. It says it supports it, but its basically support in the same way that a basketball can be used in place of a soccer ball.*<br /> <br /> *Possible, and doable with some finagling, but not clearly not what's its for or trying to do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T15:37:46-07:00","id":1419465,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1419112-are-there-any-vtts-with-solid-exalted-3rd-support?p=1419458#post1419458\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No, that was my problem with astral too. It says it supports it, but its basically support in the same way that a basketball can be used in place of a soccer ball.*<br /> <br /> *Possible, and doable with some finagling, but not clearly not what's its for or trying to do.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, the blank page as &quot;universal character sheet&quot; might be 'technically correct' but also makes me wish boils upon them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9009-evil-aardvark","name":"Evil Aardvark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-22T04:06:10-07:00","id":1419552,"title":"","content":"I've enjoyed a combination of Discord, Dicebot and Lot-Casting Atemi, and liked that quite a lot more than Roll20, obviously YMMV.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/903-cheshire-cat","name":"Cheshire Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar903_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-23T11:54:47-07:00","id":1419826,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SamuraiMujuru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1419112-are-there-any-vtts-with-solid-exalted-3rd-support?p=1419113#post1419113\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've been running on Roll20 and the 3E sheet I found has drop downs for DB at least and does correctly calculate essence.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm also running on roll20, but I didn't think the character sheet was functional. I've got things set up decently, but I had to write a few macros to make things like die rolling smoother.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-23T14:39:06-07:00","id":1419847,"title":"","content":"I've had a chat with one of my players about cobbling together an environment and their reaction was a sigh and &quot;can't we just play something else where this just works?&quot; So... I guess Exalted goes back on the shelf again.<br /> <br /> Even if it isn't going to work out, my thanks for the help and ideas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9009-evil-aardvark","name":"Evil Aardvark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-25T07:15:34-07:00","id":1420120,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cheshire Cat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1419112-are-there-any-vtts-with-solid-exalted-3rd-support?p=1419552#post1419552\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've enjoyed a combination of Discord, Dicebot and Lot-Casting Atemi, and liked that quite a lot more than Roll20, obviously YMMV.</div> </div> </div> </div>Same. It works well for both voice and PBP in my experience. Sometimes with Roll20 for battlemaps sectioned into rough range bands, sometimes without. Roll20 maps can be good for geography stuff too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-18T08:46:57-08:00","id":1424739,"title":"","content":"There's a literal Exalted 3rd Edition virtual table-top download available in the Virtual Table Top game available on Steam. It does require everyone to buy the game, but the mod is free, has a lot of rules, charts, dice, and play aids, and has a pretty cool slew of backgrounds and virtual effects.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/286160/Tabletop_Simulator/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/286160/Tabletop_Simulator/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/286160/Tabletop_Simulator/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://store.steampowered.com/app/286160/Tabletop_Simulator/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://exalted-golden-shackles-iron-crowns.obsidianportal.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://exalted-golden-shackles-iron...dianportal.com</a> Visit Golden Shackles, Iron Crowns; a 3rd Edition Exalted Campaign ongoing since 2014","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2711-janissary87","name":"Janissary87","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2711_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-18T12:10:39-08:00","id":1424799,"title":"","content":"We transitioned our in-person game to my Discord when the pandemic really hit. I wrote a basic die-bot for it that everyone seems to like. I intended to enhance it but no one really wanted anything else so I haven't touched it. The switch to Discord was the best thing for us since the games are now way more regular. We tried Roll20 but it mostly didn't help much. If we were to try anything else we'd try the TTS mod.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>--Lurker Extraordinaire!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/344-darkwolff","name":"DarkWolff","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar344_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}